  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Feasibility Study - Open Radio Access Network Pilot Project Feasibility Study, through Telecom Infra Project, Inc.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A USTDA grant for Indonesia&apos;s Ministry of Communication and Informatics is funding a feasibility study and proof-of-concept to assess the commercial and technical viability of deploying open radio access network (Open RAN) technology to provide digital connectivity for approximately 1,621 unserved villages across Indonesia.</narrative>
